      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I get started with Zunkiree Labs?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Start with a free consultation call where we discuss your requirements and goals. We then provide a detailed proposal within 3-5 business days. Once approved, we begin with a discovery phase to finalize technical specifications before development starts."
